# The mods the deployed page loads into its machines (win95.js), the page's own when neither its address (mods=NAME)
# nor its server (tools/serve.py --mods NAME) names another file: one a line, NAME or NAME:VALUE as the address's
# mod=NAME[:VALUE]
# Solitaire's Game > Win! (mod-solwin.js), and Solitaire on a processor of its day's pace (mod-turbo.js below 1: its
# bouncing cards have no timing of their own)
solwin
turbo:0.05@SOL
